pve-console-wall (1.0.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fix blank Datacenter view (PVE 7/8/9). The datacenter-tree override
    captured and re-invoked me.callParent, which breaks ExtJS's parent-method
    chain and broke PVE.dc.Config construction. Reworked to override the base
    PVE.panel.Config.initComponent and append the Console Wall tab to me.items
    for the Datacenter instance only, using a normal callParent().

 -- Console Wall Plugin <noreply@example.com>  Fri, 24 Jul 2026 18:00:00 +0000

pve-console-wall (1.0.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fix: register ExtJS widget aliases (widget.pveConsoleWall,
    widget.pveConsoleWallTile, widget.pveConsoleWallSelector). Without the
    alias, {xtype: 'pveConsoleWall'} in the Datacenter-tree override threw
    "Unrecognized class alias" and broke PVE.dc.Config, leaving the
    Datacenter view blank.

 -- Console Wall Plugin <noreply@example.com>  Fri, 24 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000

pve-console-wall (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Datacenter -> Console Wall multi-console grid dashboard.
  * Live noVNC consoles with auto-reconnect and health-coloured borders.
  * CPU/RAM/network overlays, VM search and node/tag filtering.
  * Interactive and read-only modes; per-guest quick actions.
  * Saved layouts (server-side, per user) and auto-rotation.
  * APT hook to re-apply the UI injection after pve-manager upgrades.

 -- Console Wall Plugin <noreply@example.com>  Fri, 24 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
